WEBVTT

00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:02.961
A local test may replace a provider with a fake response.

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:06.037
That can prove your application reacts correctly to that

00:00:06.107 --> 00:00:09.741
response, but it cannot prove the real provider accepts

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:11.645
your account or delivers a message.

00:00:12.341 --> 00:00:15.511
A provider's acceptance is a stronger but still different

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:18.007
observation from a real user seeing the effect.

00:00:18.611 --> 00:00:20.886
Record the environment and the exact claim.

00:00:21.269 --> 00:00:24.346
"Not yet tested" is a useful status when it keeps the next

00:00:24.392 --> 00:00:26.192
person from assuming proof exists.
